  "description": {
    "text": "The autumn Battle Roads of the 2011-2012 season, held in game stores across North America from 17 September to 16 October 2011, the first to award Championship Points. Instead of a medal for the winner, the top three each got a Victory Cup card stamped Battle Road Autumn 2011, one print each for first, second and third place, with booster packs down to fourth place. The cups reuse the art of the trophy cards of Japan's 2011 Battle Carnival.",
